       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI99402.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI99402.
      *
      *     Upload Extracto do BdM
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SWF0010-FILE ASSIGN      TO DISK-SWF0010
                              FILE STATUS  IS VIAW0011-FSTATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            FILE SECTION
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       FD  SWF0010-FILE.
           COPY SWCF0010.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI99402         '.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5806 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7302 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7401 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7501 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
       01  DCLNCCCBCOR.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF NCCCBCOR PREFIX BY 'NCCCBCOR-'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV9940.
       COPY SWCV9941.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY AQCK0001.
       COPY AQCW0005.
       COPY VIAW0011.
       COPY VIAW0030.
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY VIAL0030.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * SWITCHES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-EXTRATO                   PIC S9(04) COMP
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-EXTRATO-OK                        VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-EXTRATO-NOT-OK                    VALUE -1.
           05 SW-FILE-STATE                PIC S9(04) COMP
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-FILE-OK                           VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-END-OF-FILE                       VALUE -1.
           05 SW-FILE                      PIC S9(04) COMP
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-FILE-OPEN                         VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-FILE-CLOSE                        VALUE -1.
           05 SW-CTRL-LINHA                PIC S9(04) COMP
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-LINHA-NEXISTE                     VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-LINHA-EXISTE                      VALUE -1.
           05 SW-TIPO-REGISTO              PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-FIRST-LINE                        VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-HEADER-LINE                       VALUE 'H'.
              88 SW-DETAIL-LINE                       VALUE 'D'.
           05 SW-HEADER                    PIC S9(04)        VALUE  0.
              88 SW-NOT-1ST-HEADER                           VALUE  0.
              88 SW-1ST-HEADER                               VALUE -1.
           05 SW-IND-ERROS                 PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SEM-AVISOS                        VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SEM-ERROS                         VALUE  0,  1.
              88 SW-COM-ERROS                         VALUE  2,  3.
              88 SW-COM-AVISO                         VALUE  1.
              88 SW-COM-ERRO                          VALUE  2.
              88 SW-COM-ERRO-GRAVE                    VALUE  3.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
      *
           05 CON-SWVT7302                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7302'.
           05 CON-SWVT7401                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7401'.
           05 CON-SWVT7501                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7501'.
           05 CON-SWVT5806                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT5806'.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
           05 CON-A-PROCESSAR              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-PROCESSADO               PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-S                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-N                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-p                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'p'.
           05 CON-COM-ERROS                PIC  X(01) VALUE 'X'.
           05 CON-SYS-COMMAND              PIC  X(10) VALUE 'OVRDBF'.
           05 CON-FILENAME                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWF0010'.
           05 CON-SPACE                    PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           05 CON-SEPARATOR                PIC  X(01) VALUE '/'.
           05 CON-QCMDEXC                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'QCMDEXC'.
           05 CON-LENGTH                   PIC S9(10)V9(05) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE +256.
           05 CON-PREFFIX                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'Z'.
           05 CON-UNIDADE                  PIC  9(07) VALUE 0000001.
           05 CON-CODMSG                   PIC  X(06) VALUE 'MT940'.

           05 CON-DEBITO                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
           05 CON-CREDITO                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'C'.
           05 CON-CBAN                     PIC  X(04) VALUE 'BMOC'.
           05 CON-CSPAI                    PIC  X(02) VALUE 'MZ'.
           05 CON-CNIVREC                  PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI99402'.
           05 WS-COMMAND                   PIC  X(256) VALUE SPACES.
      *    05 WS-DESC1                     PIC  X(36) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DDATAUPL                  PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-ZSEQFILE                  PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE  0.
      *
           05 WS-COSN                      PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-COSN.
              10 WS-PREFFIX                PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-COSN-VAL               PIC  9(09).
              10 FILLER REDEFINES WS-COSN-VAL.
                 15 WS-COSN-ANO            PIC  9(02).
                 15 WS-COSN-SEQ            PIC  9(07).
      *
           05 WS-COSNC                     PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-COSNC-NLINHA REDEFINES WS-COSNC
                                           PIC  9(10).
      *
           05 WS-DTOP                      PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DTOP.
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-DTOP-ANO               PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(04).
      *
           05 WS-DATE-TODAY                PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DATA-EXTRATO              PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
      *
           05 WS-CTRL-SLD                  PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-CTRL-PAG                  PIC S9(05)V      COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-CTRL-LIN                  PIC S9(03)V      COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-NLINHA                    PIC S9(05) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-NLIN-PAG                  PIC S9(05) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-NPAGINA                   PIC S9(05) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
      *
           05 WS-EDT-NPAGINA               PIC  Z(2).Z(2)9.
           05 WS-EDT-NLINHA                PIC  Z9.
      *
           05 WS-CREFEXT                   PIC  X(16).
              10 WS-CBAN                   PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-CMOEDA                 PIC  X(03).
              10 WS-DATA                   PIC  X(08).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
      *
           05 WS-CSPAI                     PIC  X(02).
      *
           05 WS-DT-OPER                   PIC  X(10).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DT-OPER.
              10 WS-OPER-DIA               PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-OPER-MES               PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-OPER-ANO               PIC  9(04).
      *
           05 WS-DT-ANSI                   PIC  X(10).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DT-ANSI.
              10 WS-ANSI-ANO               PIC  9(04).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-ANSI-MES               PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-ANSI-DIA               PIC  9(02).
      *
           05 WS-MSALDO-INICIAL            PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-MSALDO-FINAL              PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-TOTAL-CREDITO             PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-TOTAL-DEBITO              PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
      *
           05 WS-MSALDO                    PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-MVALOR                    PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-CDBCR                     PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-GDESCR                    PIC  X(40) VALUE SPACES.
      *
           05 WS-RESULT                    PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-STRING                    PIC  X(27).
           05 WS-STRAUX                    PIC  X(27).
      *
           05 WS-CALLER-ID                 PIC  X(30) VALUE SPACES.
      *
           05 WS-AUX                       PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-GDESCERR                  PIC  X(80) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-I                         PIC S9(04) COMP.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI99402         '.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV9940-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9940-ASE               TO SWCV9941-ASE.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO WS-DATE-TODAY
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCV9940-CFILEXTR'     TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SWCV9940-CFILEXTR      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SWCV9940-CLIBRNAM'     TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  SWCV9940-CLIBRNAM      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              MOVE 'SWCV9940-CFILENAM'     TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(3)
              MOVE  SWCV9940-CFILENAM      TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV9940-CFILEXTR EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FEXTERN    TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV9940-CLIBRNAM EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV9941-CLIBRNAM-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-LIBNAME    TO SWCV9941-CLIBRNAM-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV9941-CLIBRNAM-CAPLIC
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV9940-CFILENAM EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV9941-CFILENAM-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FILNAME    TO SWCV9941-CFILENAM-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV9941-CFILENAM-CAPLIC
      *
           END-IF.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9940-ADE               TO SWCV9941-ADE.
      *
      * Processamento do extrato BdM
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO
                 THRU 2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              EXEC SQL ROLLBACK END-EXEC
              SET SW-EXTRATO-NOT-OK     TO TRUE
              SET VIAL0002-OK           TO TRUE
           END-IF.

      *
      * upload do extrato BdM
      *
           IF SW-EXTRATO-OK
              PERFORM 2500-TRATA-SALDO
                 THRU 2500-TRATA-SALDO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2600-TRATA-EXTRATO
              THRU 2600-TRATA-EXTRATO-EXIT

           IF  NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
           OR  SW-EXTRATO-NOT-OK
               EXEC SQL COMMIT END-EXEC
               SET VIAL0002-OK           TO TRUE
           END-IF.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-COMMAND
                                              WS-GDESCERR.
      *
           STRING 'OVRDBF '
               CON-FILENAME                DELIMITED BY SIZE
               ' ' SWCV9940-CLIBRNAM       DELIMITED BY SPACES
               '/' SWCV9940-CFILENAM       DELIMITED BY SPACES
                                         INTO WS-COMMAND.

           CALL SWCK0002-CMD-QCMDEXC USING WS-COMMAND
                                         , SWCK0002-CMD-LENGTH

           PERFORM 2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO
              THRU 2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-READ-FICHEIRO
                 THRU 2220-READ-FICHEIRO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SWCF0010-DTFIM             TO WS-DT-OPER
              MOVE ALL '-'                    TO WS-DT-ANSI
              MOVE WS-OPER-DIA                TO WS-ANSI-DIA
              MOVE WS-OPER-MES                TO WS-ANSI-MES
              MOVE WS-OPER-ANO                TO WS-ANSI-ANO
              MOVE WS-DT-ANSI                 TO WS-DATA-EXTRATO

              PERFORM 2300-PROC-FICHEIRO
                 THRU 2300-PROC-FICHEIRO-EXIT
                UNTIL NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                   OR SW-END-OF-FILE
                   OR SW-EXTRATO-NOT-OK
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              COMPUTE WS-MSALDO-FINAL  = WS-MSALDO-INICIAL +
                      WS-TOTAL-CREDITO - WS-TOTAL-DEBITO

              IF WS-MSALDO-FINAL      NOT EQUAL WS-MSALDO
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-TOT-CR-DB TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE 'Total de mov. a debito/credito invalidos '
                                             to WS-GDESCERR
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF SW-FILE-OPEN
              PERFORM 2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO
                 THRU 2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2200-TRATA-FICHEIRO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-CTRL-SLD
                                              WS-NLINHA
                                              WS-CTRL-PAG
                                              WS-CTRL-LIN
                                              WS-MSALDO-INICIAL
                                              WS-TOTAL-DEBITO
                                              WS-TOTAL-CREDITO.
      *
           SET  SW-FILE-OK
                SW-FIRST-LINE              TO TRUE.
      *
           OPEN INPUT SWF0010-FILE.
      *
           PERFORM 9030-FSCHECK
              THRU 9039-FSCHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT VIAW0011-OK
              SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-OPEN      TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
           ELSE
              SET SW-FILE-OPEN            TO TRUE
           END-IF.
      *
       2210-OPEN-FICHEIRO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2220-READ-FICHEIRO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2220-READ-FICHEIRO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2220-READ-FICHEIRO'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           READ SWF0010-FILE.
      *
           PERFORM 9030-FSCHECK
              THRU 9039-FSCHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN VIAW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
           WHEN VIAW0011-EOF
                 SET  SW-END-OF-FILE       TO TRUE
           WHEN VIAW0011-RECSIZ
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO TRUE
                MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FICHEIRO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2220-READ-FICHEIRO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           CLOSE SWF0010-FILE.
      *
           PERFORM 9030-FSCHECK
              THRU 9039-FSCHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN VIAW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO TRUE
                MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-CLOSE      TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2230-CLOSE-FICHEIRO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2300-PROC-FICHEIRO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-PROC-FICHEIRO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-PROC-FICHEIRO'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET SW-EXTRATO-OK         TO TRUE
      *
           PERFORM 2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO
              THRU 2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO
                 THRU 2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-LINHA-EXISTE
                   CONTINUE
              WHEN SW-DETAIL-LINE
                   PERFORM 2400-COMPOR-LINHA
                      THRU 2400-COMPOR-LINHA-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-LINHA-EXISTE
                   CONTINUE
              WHEN SW-DETAIL-LINE
                   PERFORM 2410-INSERIR-LINHA
                      THRU 2410-INSERIR-LINHA-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-LINHA-EXISTE
                   CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   PERFORM 2420-COMPOR-CONTROLO
                      THRU 2420-COMPOR-CONTROLO-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-LINHA-EXISTE
                   CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   PERFORM 2430-INSERIR-CONTROLO
                      THRU 2430-INSERIR-CONTROLO-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-READ-FICHEIRO
                 THRU 2220-READ-FICHEIRO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2300-PROC-FICHEIRO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCF0010-CDATETIME         TO SWCD7501-CDATETIME.
           MOVE SWCF0010-NPAGINA           TO SWCD7501-NPAGINA.
           MOVE SWCF0010-NLINHA            TO SWCD7501-NLINHA.
           MOVE SWCF0010-MSALDO            TO SWCD7501-MSALDO.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT COSN
                   , COSNC
                INTO :SWCD7501-COSN
                   , :SWCD7501-COSNC
                FROM SWVT7501
               WHERE CDATETIME  =  :SWCD7501-CDATETIME
                 AND NPAGINA    =  :SWCD7501-NPAGINA
                 AND NLINHA     =  :SWCD7501-NLINHA
                 AND MSALDO     =  :SWCD7501-MSALDO
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7501     TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 SET  SW-LINHA-EXISTE      TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCD7501-COSN        TO WS-COSN
                 MOVE SWCD7501-COSNC       TO WS-COSNC
                 IF WS-COSNC EQUAL SPACES
                    MOVE ZEROES            TO WS-COSNC-NLINHA
                 END-IF
                 MOVE WS-COSNC-NLINHA      TO WS-NLINHA
              WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-LINHA-NEXISTE     TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-SEL-SWT75
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE 'Erro no Select da SWT75'
                                       TO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2310-CONTROLAR-REGISTO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCF0010-CMOEDA            TO WS-CMOEDA.
           MOVE 'Saldo'                    TO WS-AUX.
           MOVE SWCF0010-MSALDO            TO WS-STRING.
           PERFORM 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL
              THRU 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE WS-RESULT               TO WS-MSALDO

              MOVE SPACES                  TO WS-STRING
                                              WS-STRAUX
              PERFORM VARYING WS-I
                 FROM 1 BY 1
                UNTIL WS-I > FUNCTION LENGTH( SWCF0010-NPAGINA )
                 IF SWCF0010-NPAGINA( WS-I : 1 ) NOT EQUAL '.'
                    STRING WS-STRING        DELIMITED BY SPACES
                       SWCF0010-NPAGINA( WS-I : 1 )
                                            DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                          INTO WS-STRAUX
                    MOVE WS-STRAUX          TO WS-STRING
                 END-IF
              END-PERFORM
              MOVE 'Página'                TO WS-AUX
              PERFORM 2340-CONVERT-INTEGER
                 THRU 2340-CONVERT-INTEGER-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE WS-RESULT               TO WS-NPAGINA
      *
              MOVE SWCF0010-NLINHA         TO WS-STRING
              MOVE 'Linha'                 TO WS-AUX
              PERFORM 2340-CONVERT-INTEGER
                 THRU 2340-CONVERT-INTEGER-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE WS-RESULT               TO WS-NLIN-PAG
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN SWCF0010-DDATA          NOT EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-GDESCR         NOT EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-CDOCUM         NOT EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-DTVALOR        NOT EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-MDEBITO        NOT EQUAL ZEROES
              WHEN SWCF0010-MCREDITO       NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 SET  SW-DETAIL-LINE
                      SW-NOT-1ST-HEADER    TO TRUE
                 ADD  +1                   TO WS-CTRL-LIN
              WHEN SW-FIRST-LINE
                 SET  SW-HEADER-LINE
                      SW-1ST-HEADER        TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-MSALDO            TO WS-CTRL-SLD
                                              WS-MSALDO-INICIAL
                 MOVE +1                   TO WS-CTRL-PAG
                 MOVE ZEROES               TO WS-CTRL-LIN
                 IF SW-LINHA-NEXISTE
                    PERFORM 2350-OBTER-OSN
                       THRU 2350-OBTER-OSN-EXIT
                 END-IF

                 IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                    PERFORM 2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL
                       THRU 2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL-EXIT

                    IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                       IF  SWCD7302-MSALDEXT NOT EQUAL WS-MSALDO-INICIAL
                           SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                           MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                             TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                                             TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                           MOVE SWCK0001-SALDO-INIC-INV
                                             TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                           MOVE 'Saldo inicial invalido'  TO WS-GDESCERR
                       END-IF
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              WHEN SW-DETAIL-LINE
                 SET  SW-HEADER-LINE       TO TRUE
                 ADD  +1                   TO WS-CTRL-PAG
                 MOVE ZEROES               TO WS-CTRL-LIN
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 MOVE 'Extracto vazio'     TO WS-GDESCERR
              WHEN SW-HEADER-LINE
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 STRING '2 linhas de transporte detectadas P g. '
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN NOT SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN WS-CTRL-PAG             NOT EQUAL WS-NPAGINA
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 STRING 'Numero de pagina inválido (Pág.) '
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
              WHEN WS-CTRL-LIN             NOT EQUAL WS-NLIN-PAG
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 STRING 'Numero de linha inválido (Pág.) '
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN NOT SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN WS-CTRL-SLD             NOT EQUAL WS-MSALDO
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-SALDO-TRANS-INV TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 STRING 'Saldo de transporte inválido Pag. '
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN SWCF0010-DDATA          EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-GDESCR         EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-CDOCUM         EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-DTVALOR        EQUAL SPACES
              WHEN SWCF0010-MDEBITO        EQUAL ZEROES
               AND SWCF0010-MCREDITO       EQUAL ZEROES
              WHEN SWCF0010-MDEBITO        NOT EQUAL ZEROES
               AND SWCF0010-MCREDITO       NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-DADOS-INV-EXT-BDM
                                             TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 MOVE WS-NLIN-PAG            TO WS-EDT-NLINHA
                 STRING 'Dados invalidos no extrato BdM '
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                        'Linha '           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NLINHA          DELIMITED BY SIZE
                        'Pag. '            DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-HEADER-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN SWCF0010-MDEBITO        NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE CON-DEBITO           TO WS-CDBCR
                 MOVE SWCF0010-MDEBITO     TO WS-STRING
                 MOVE 'Débito'             TO WS-AUX
                 PERFORM 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL
                    THRU 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL-EXIT
              WHEN SWCF0010-MCREDITO       NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE CON-CREDITO          TO WS-CDBCR
                 MOVE SWCF0010-MCREDITO    TO WS-STRING
                 MOVE 'Crédito'            TO WS-AUX
                 PERFORM 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL
                    THRU 2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN NOT SW-DETAIL-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN SWCF0010-MDEBITO        NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE WS-RESULT            TO WS-MVALOR
                 SUBTRACT WS-MVALOR        FROM WS-CTRL-SLD
                 COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-DEBITO  =
                         WS-TOTAL-DEBITO  + WS-MVALOR
              WHEN SWCF0010-MCREDITO       NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE WS-RESULT            TO WS-MVALOR
                 ADD  WS-MVALOR            TO WS-CTRL-SLD
                 COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-CREDITO =
                         WS-TOTAL-CREDITO + WS-MVALOR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN NOT SW-DETAIL-LINE
              WHEN SW-1ST-HEADER
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN WS-CTRL-SLD             NOT EQUAL WS-MSALDO
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-SALDO-DETALHE-INV
                                             TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE WS-NLIN-PAG            TO WS-EDT-NLINHA
                 MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
                 STRING 'Saldo de detalhe inválido'
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                        'Linha '           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NLINHA          DELIMITED BY SIZE
                        'Pag. '            DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    WS-EDT-NPAGINA         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2320-VALIDAR-REGISTO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SET :WS-RESULT = DECIMAL( :WS-STRING, 15, 2 )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT DB2-OK
              SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
      *       MOVE 'Erro na conversao de valores' TO WS-GDESCERR
              MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
              MOVE WS-NLIN-PAG            TO WS-EDT-NLINHA
              STRING WS-AUX               DELIMITED BY SPACES
                ' invalido(a) no extrato BdM '
                                          DELIMITED BY SIZE
                'Linha '                  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                WS-EDT-NLINHA             DELIMITED BY SIZE
                'Pag. '                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
                WS-EDT-NPAGINA            DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                        INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-IF.

       2330-CONVERT-DECIMAL-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2340-CONVERT-INTEGER
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2340-CONVERT-INTEGER.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2340-CONVERT-INTEGER' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SET :WS-RESULT = DECIMAL( :WS-STRING, 15, 0 )
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT DB2-OK
              SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-FORMATO   TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
      *       MOVE 'Erro na conversao de valores' TO WS-GDESCERR
              MOVE WS-NPAGINA             TO WS-EDT-NPAGINA
              MOVE WS-NLIN-PAG            TO WS-EDT-NLINHA
              STRING WS-AUX               DELIMITED BY SPACES
                ' invalido(a) no extrato BdM '
                                          DELIMITED BY SIZE
                'Linha '                  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                WS-EDT-NLINHA             DELIMITED BY SIZE
                'Pag. '                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
                WS-EDT-NPAGINA            DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                        INTO WS-GDESCERR
           END-IF.
      *
       2340-CONVERT-INTEGER-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2350-OBTER-OSN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2350-OBTER-OSN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2350-OBTER-OSN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE CON-PREFFIX                TO WS-PREFFIX.
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO WS-DTOP.
      *
           PERFORM 2351-SOMAR-1
              THRU 2351-SOMAR-1-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE VIAL0030-NSEQUEN-1      TO WS-COSN-VAL
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN WS-COSN-ANO EQUAL WS-DTOP-ANO
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 PERFORM 2352-INICIALIZAR
                    THRU 2352-INICIALIZAR-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2350-OBTER-OSN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2351-SOMAR-1
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2351-SOMAR-1.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2351-SOMAR-1  ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-OSN-BDM      TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-SOMA-1            TO TRUE.
      *
           CALL VIAL0030-NM-ROTINA USING VIAL0030-COMMAREA
                                         ETCL0002-COMMAREA.
      *
           IF NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-ROTINA-DATAS
                                          TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
              MOVE 'Erro na rotina de datas (Somar 1)'
                                          TO WS-GDESCERR
           END-IF.
      *
       2351-SOMAR-1-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2352-INICIALIZAR
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2352-INICIALIZAR.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2352-INICIALIZAR' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-OSN-BDM      TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-FORCA-VALOR       TO TRUE.
      *
           MOVE CON-PREFFIX                TO WS-PREFFIX.
           MOVE WS-DTOP-ANO                TO WS-COSN-ANO.
           MOVE CON-UNIDADE                TO WS-COSN-SEQ.
      *
           MOVE WS-COSN-VAL                TO VIAL0030-VALOR-ACUM.
      *
           CALL VIAL0030-NM-ROTINA USING VIAL0030-COMMAREA
                                         ETCL0002-COMMAREA.
      *
           IF NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC        TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-ROTINA-DATAS
                                          TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
              MOVE 'Erro na rotina de datas (inicializar)'
                                          TO WS-GDESCERR
           END-IF.
      *
       2352-INICIALIZAR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE 'BMOC'                     TO SWCD7302-CBAN
           MOVE 'MZ'                       TO SWCD7302-CSPAI
           MOVE 'S'                        TO SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
           MOVE SWCF0010-CMOEDA            TO SWCD7302-CMOED
           MOVE WS-DATA-EXTRATO            TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MSALDEXT
                INTO :SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
                FROM SWVT7302
               WHERE CBAN       =  :SWCD7302-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI      =  :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED      =  :SWCD7302-CMOED
                 AND DATVAL     <  :SWCD7302-DATVAL
                 AND ISALDEXT   =  :SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
               ORDER BY DATVAL DESC
               FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7302     TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-SALDO-INIC-N-EXIST
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE 'Saldo inicial inexistente na SWT73'
                                       TO WS-GDESCERR
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO  TO TRUE
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-SEL-SWT73
                                       TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE 'Erro no Select da SWT73'
                                       TO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2360-OBTEM-SALDO-INICIAL-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2400-COMPOR-LINHA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2400-COMPOR-LINHA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2400-COMPOR-LINHA  ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE CON-CODMSG                 TO SWCD5806-CCODMSG.
      *
           MOVE SWCF0010-DTVALOR           TO WS-DT-OPER.
           MOVE ALL '-'                    TO WS-DT-ANSI.
           MOVE WS-OPER-DIA                TO WS-ANSI-DIA.
           MOVE WS-OPER-MES                TO WS-ANSI-MES.
           MOVE WS-OPER-ANO                TO WS-ANSI-ANO.
           MOVE WS-DT-ANSI                 TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5806-DATVAL.
      *
           MOVE SWCF0010-CDOCUM            TO SWCD5806-CREF.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CREFOPR.
           MOVE CON-CBAN                   TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE CON-CSPAI                  TO WS-CSPAI.
      *
           MOVE WS-DATA-EXTRATO            TO AQCW0005-DTX10
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO WS-DATA.
      *
           MOVE WS-CREFEXT                 TO SWCD5806-CREFEXT.

           STRING WS-CBAN                DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-CSPAI               DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO SWCD5806-CSEND.

           MOVE WS-CBAN                    TO SWCD5806-CBAN.
           MOVE WS-CSPAI                   TO SWCD5806-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCK0002-CODEST-PEND       TO SWCD5806-CCODEST.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CTIPOP.
           MOVE WS-MVALOR                  TO SWCD5806-MVALOR.
           MOVE WS-CMOEDA                  TO SWCD5806-CMOED.
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA       TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5806-DATREC.
PML        MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD5806-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CTRATRYP
                                              SWCD5806-CCODOPE.
           MOVE WS-CDBCR                   TO SWCD5806-CDBCR.
           MOVE WS-DATE-TODAY              TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5806-DREG.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5806-NOPRREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-MOTIVO
                                              SWCD5806-OBSER.
           STRING FUNCTION TRIM( SWCF0010-GDESCR )
                                           DELIMITED BY SIZE
              ' '                          DELIMITED BY SIZE
              SWCF0010-CDOCUM              DELIMITED BY SPACES
                                         INTO SWCD5806-GDESC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CBYPASS
                                              SWCD5806-CSENDREC.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5806-MVLRREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CMOEDREC
                                              SWCD5806-CROPRREC
                                              SWCD5806-CORIGEMREC.
           MOVE CON-CNIVREC                TO SWCD5806-CNIVREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD5806-CUSERID.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5806-CEXT.
           MOVE WS-NPAGINA                 TO SWCD5806-CPAG.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5806-NORDREC.
      *
