      *                   2520-OBTEM-CCB
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2520-OBTEM-CCB.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2520-OBTEM-CCB'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-CMOEDA                  TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED.
           MOVE CON-CBAN                   TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE CON-CSPAI                  TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT NCCCBALC
                   , NCCCCCB
                INTO :NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC
                   , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB
                FROM NCCCBCOR
               WHERE NCCCCBAN  =  :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI =  :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                 AND NCCCMOED  =  :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-CCB-N-EXIST TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE 'CCB Inexistente na tab. NCCCBCOR'
                                           TO WS-GDESCERR
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-SEL-NCCCBCOR
                                           TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
                 MOVE 'Erro no select da tab. NCCCBCOR'
                                           TO WS-GDESCERR
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2520-OBTEM-CCB-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2600-TRATA-EXTRATO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2600-TRATA-EXTRATO.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2600-TRATA-EXTRATO'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-DATA-EXTRATO            TO SWCD7401-DDATAUPL.
           MOVE SWCV9940-CFILEXTR          TO SWCD7401-CFILEXTR.
           IF SW-EXTRATO-OK
              MOVE CON-PROCESSADO          TO SWCD7401-CPROCESS
           ELSE
              MOVE CON-COM-ERROS           TO SWCD7401-CPROCESS
           END-IF
           MOVE WS-GDESCERR                TO SWCD7401-GDESCERR
           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD7401-CUSERIDC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7401-CUSERID.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7401
                 SET CPROCESS  =  :SWCD7401-CPROCESS
                   , GDESCERR  =  :SWCD7401-GDESCERR
                   , CUSERID   =  :SWCD7401-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST   =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE DDATAUPL  =  :SWCD7401-DDATAUPL
                 AND CFILEXTR  =  :SWCD7401-CFILEXTR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7401               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                 PERFORM 2610-REGISTA-EXTRATO
                    THRU 2610-REGISTA-EXTRATO-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-UPD-SWT74
                                           TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV9941-CFILEXTR-CAPLIC
           END-EVALUATE.
